        "title": "Ai lunge luang kaumei rukhou",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ai lunge luang kaumei rukhou,",
            "Kachak ting palikmei khou;",
            "Kandih khou #@8 gaipui ram tei,",
            "Amang thu dukhou manne,",
            "Hei khou tei npuan nthan ne,",
            "Munrim kajauna liu e,",
            "Duipuak kai khou tei lummei guai,",
            "Kaniu pap tei khiu than the.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Heitei gaimei kandih ram su,",
            "Suaihiam loumei gaipui ramme;",
            "Rimgaimei munpuang tuai makge,",
            "Neiriu ni gan tak lak khe.",
            "",
            "2. Ai#@8 jang e duipuak kai khou,",
            "Hei khou tei ai #@8 bam ni;",
            "Ringmei dui tei jang lou khou #@8,",
            "Abumang tari kim the,",
            "Ai #@8 tari dat pulak khe.",
            "Phei banni neilamei phei,",
            "Hei khou tei nthuk pui lu tei,",
            "Ai tingmik thui suan puni.",
            "",
            "3. Ai #@8 nchum pui chang tat khang,",
            "Kross tei tik kagun dai e;",
            "Ai #@8 nchumpui chang tat khang,",
            "Ai hou e kanpat pui bam,",
            "Jisu #@8 njianna kau e,",
            "Kross tei phung khang ping lak khe,",
            "Jisu #@8 sa e, ai #@8 naNang chang kasiam lou the."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
